=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:10pt; color:rgb(36,36,36)\"><b>&lt;로그 수집 단계&gt;</b></span></p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"text-align:left; margin-top:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><li style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(36,36,36); margin:0cm\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:10pt\">Windows&nbsp;시작 메뉴에서 “단계 레코더” 앱을 실행하여 기록을 시작해주십시오.</span></li></ol><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:10pt; color:rgb(36,36,36)\"><img id=\"x_그림_x0020_10\" width=\"403\" height=\"96\" size=\"55152\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:3c2b02c1-4b4d-468c-8b1f-9721a4d69aa9\" data-attachment-id=\"d7c302e4-e8e5-4266-b380-fa848f5e5496\" style=\"width:4.2in; height:1in; max-width:1057px; min-width:auto; min-height:auto; margin:0px\"><br>(또는&nbsp;PowerPoint&nbsp;에서&nbsp;Office&nbsp;녹화를 진행해주셔도 무관합니다.)</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(36,36,36)\"><img id=\"x_그림_x0020_1980867915\" width=\"699\" height=\"133\" size=\"34618\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:dbdb4e44-889e-45c2-8c74-8468d0df3918\" data-attachment-id=\"5ffb6239-b121-4cc9-bc95-46905cc4266b\" style=\"width:7.2833in; height:1.3916in; max-width:1057px; min-width:auto; min-height:auto; margin:0px\"></span></p><ol start=\"2\" style=\"text-align:left; margin-top:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><li style=\"font-family:굴림; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(36,36,36); margin:0cm\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,serif,EmojiFont; font-size:10pt\">웹브라우저 In-private 모드로 새 창을 열어주